WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:13.453
Vinnie and Mandy ran down the road and happened to see a domed building.

2
00:00:13.454 --> 00:00:16.018
It had six towers.

3
00:00:16.019 --> 00:00:19.010
The guards were still chasing them.

4
00:00:19.011 --> 00:00:25.084
"Isn't that in the photo?" Mandy called, pointing.

5
00:00:25.085 --> 00:00:28.802
"Yes!" Vinnie said happily.

6
00:00:28.803 --> 00:00:31.148
The guards were very close.

7
00:00:31.149 --> 00:00:33.548
But the children weren't worried.

8
00:00:33.549 --> 00:00:37.490
"We're going home," thought Vinnie.

9
00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.585
They closed their eyes.

10
00:00:39.586 --> 00:00:42.003
But nothing happened.

11
00:00:42.004 --> 00:00:46.029
"What's wrong?" cried Mandy, scared.

12
00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.137
She looked around.

13
00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:52.742
People were walking toward them carrying small rugs.

14
00:00:52.743 --> 00:00:55.481
"We'd better hide."

15
00:00:55.482 --> 00:00:58.620
"Come with me!" cried Vinnie.

16
00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:03.902
He grabbed Mandy and joined the crowd walking through a large door.

17
00:01:03.903 --> 00:01:07.076
The guards ran up and looked around.

18
00:01:07.077 --> 00:01:10.876
"Where did they go?" one guard said.

19
00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:14.678
Vinnie and Mandy walked into a courtyard.

20
00:01:14.679 --> 00:01:18.135
Soon, they met a boy and a girl.

21
00:01:18.136 --> 00:01:21.706
"Where is your mother?" asked the girl.

22
00:01:21.707 --> 00:01:24.941
She had a scarf covering her head.

23
00:01:24.942 --> 00:01:28.549
"Where is your father?" asked the boy.

24
00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:31.679
"We're alone," said Vinnie.

25
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.739
"Then come," said the girl.

26
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.703
"My name is Feyza and this is my brother, Nesim."

27
00:01:39.704 --> 00:01:43.137
Mandy and Vinnie introduced themselves.

28
00:01:43.138 --> 00:01:47.008
"Welcome to our mosque," said Feyza.

29
00:01:47.009 --> 00:01:52.541
She smiled and took Mandy's hand.

30
00:01:52.542 --> 00:01:55.944
"So it's a mosque, not a temple!"

31
00:01:55.945 --> 00:02:00.945
thought Vinnie, as Nesim led him to a different door.

32
00:02:00.946 --> 00:02:04.878
"Women and men pray separately," said Feyza.

33
00:02:04.879 --> 00:02:06.854
"Here is a scarf, Mandy.

34
00:02:06.855 --> 00:02:09.749
Girls must wear them in here."

35
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:14.097
Mandy put the scarf on as they walked along.

36
00:02:14.098 --> 00:02:17.202
"Take off your shoes," said Feyza.

37
00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.005
"Shoes are not permitted in the mosque."

38
00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:23.466
The girls walked barefoot to a fountain.

39
00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:27.006
"Let's wash our feet," she said.

40
00:02:27.007 --> 00:02:30.933
"Muslims always wash before praying to Allah."

41
00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:34.334
"Is Allah the name you use for God?"

42
00:02:34.335 --> 00:02:38.539
asked Mandy, putting her feet in the water.

43
00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:43.827
"Yes. And we pray five times a day," said Feyza.

44
00:02:43.828 --> 00:02:48.536
The girls finished washing and walked upstairs to a balcony.

45
00:02:48.537 --> 00:02:50.247
"Don't be afraid.

46
00:02:50.248 --> 00:02:53.550
Just do what I do," said Feyza.

47
00:02:53.551 --> 00:02:57.896
Meanwhile, Vinnie watched Nesim closely.

48
00:02:57.897 --> 00:03:00.483
They were on the main floor.

49
00:03:00.484 --> 00:03:06.539
Vinnie and Nesim joined the men who were kneeling and bowing side by side.

50
00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.809
Then Nesim got up.

51
00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:12.218
"Noon prayers are over!" he said.

52
00:03:12.219 --> 00:03:14.354
The boys went outside.

53
00:03:14.355 --> 00:03:17.074
Mandy and Feyza were waiting.

54
00:03:17.075 --> 00:03:21.534
"Thank you for showing us your mosque," said Mandy.

55
00:03:21.535 --> 00:03:24.634
"You're welcome," said Feyza.

56
00:03:24.635 --> 00:03:26.476
"We have to go home now.

57
00:03:26.477 --> 00:03:32.207
I'm glad that we met you!"

58
00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:36.678
Mandy and Vinnie were now all alone in the street.

59
00:03:36.679 --> 00:03:40.745
"I felt so safe in there," said Vinnie.

60
00:03:40.746 --> 00:03:45.681
"Well, we're not safe out here," said Mandy.

61
00:03:45.682 --> 00:03:49.203
Vinnie took out the photo.

62
00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:51.483
"Why couldn't we return home?

63
00:03:51.484 --> 00:03:55.210
The building looks the same," said Vinnie.

64
00:03:55.211 --> 00:03:59.071
Mandy looked at the picture and looked up.

65
00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:02.204
This mosque had six towers.

66
00:04:02.205 --> 00:04:06.213
"It's the wrong place!" Mandy said.

67
00:04:06.214 --> 00:04:10.601
Suddenly a guard appeared and grabbed the children.

68
00:04:10.602 --> 00:04:17.921
"The sultan wants to see you!" he said.
